{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15974","headline":"水运行 · 王建","name":"水运行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西江运船立红帜，万棹千帆绕江水。\n去年六月无稻苗，已说水乡人饿死。\n县官部船日算程，暴风恶雨亦不停。\n在生有乐当有苦，三年作官一年行。\n坏舟畏鼠复畏漏，恐向太仓折升斗。\n辛勤耕种非毒药，看着不入农夫口。\n用尽百金不爲贵，但得一金即爲利。\n远徵海稻供边食，岂如多种边头地。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15974.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15974","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}